4.0.6 (v65536), SDK 15, DOMO's in-house engine on a self-hosted
SDL-switch 2.24.0. SDL's opengles2 driver builds the context (the GLES
entry points of the previous commit), the game compiles its GLSL
through it at run time, and the video module (subsdk4) draws its
playback with NVN from two GLSLC run-time binaries, captured into
shader_map.tsv: without it the first movie aborts the process.
Plays on the Mac; not checked on the iPhone.

